  "alt": "Publishing clears a draft flag on the record, but a separate visibility map decides whether the section is shown at all. Both must open for a reader to see the piece; clearing only one produces a published record nobody can reach. A preview token bypasses both gates for one record, which is why it must never be used to check that publishing worked.",
